In VS Code, click the + icon at the top right of the terminal panel to open a new tab. Or use the top menu: Terminal → New Terminal.
Make sure you registered the account first, through the website, as a normal Student.
Paste this command, replacing the email with the one you registered with, and press Enter:
   mysql -u root -proot cms_db -e "UPDATE users SET role='Admin' WHERE email='your-email@gmail.com';"
Check that it worked:
   mysql -u root -proot cms_db -e "SELECT email, role FROM users;"

Your email should now show Admin in the role column.

